1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:02:49,130
Mira: Do you find the dating chính sách in Vietnam a bit strange? In Russia, we don't have so many complicated rules.

2
00:02:49,180 --> 00:05:38,310
Michael: Actually, every place has its own chính sách about relationships. I notice Vietnamese people tend to want to meet family early, while in America it's much more relaxed. But I think what matters is the real feelings between two people.

3
00:05:38,360 --> 00:10:20,244
Mira: Feelings? Men like you always talk about feelings but understand nothing. My chính sách is to find a man who knows how to tôn trọng truyền thống values. Do you think you're that type of person?

4
00:10:20,294 --> 00:16:54,932
Michael: I tôn trọng truyền thống values, but I also believe in equality. Perhaps our dating chính sách could be a combination - both tôn trọng truyền thống while still being open to new ideas. But... wait, why are we talking about this anyway?

5
00:16:54,982 --> 00:17:51,358
Mira: I... I'm just discussing! Don't misunderstand! I'm not suggesting anything. By the way, would you like to go to an art exhibition next week? I heard they'll have works by Russian artists too...

